		<language name="JPN_KANJI" width="216">シュッ　シュッ！</language>
	</row>

	<row id="TRID_FANM_07_TRMSG_FIGHT_START_2">
		<language name="JPN" width="216">セイッ！▼
みたか　ボクの　ひっさつサーブ！▼
