	</row>

	<row id="TRID_WORKER2_34_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<language name="JPN" width="216">つきぬけたぜ……！</language>
		<language name="JPN_KANJI" width="216">突き抜けたぜ……！</language>
	</row>

	<row id="TRID_WORKER2_34_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER">
		<language name="JPN" width="216">あせみず　たらして　ほりまくり
